; Enforce engines.node from package.json so installs fail fast on
; unsupported Node versions instead of merely warning. The accepted
; range is defined entirely by engines.node — only the Node majors
; explicitly listed there are allowed. Automatic major bumps in the
; Docker image and in dependabot.yml are blocked so any change to
; the supported Node majors goes through a deliberate review.
engine-strict=true
